{"nodes": [{"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_moriarty_bounded_atomic_1", "label": "moriarty-bounded-atomic/1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "S2 provisional corrected candidate, specified-only and not frozen or implemented. Changing numeric width, codec, bounds, effect/obligation/status/authority schema, lifecycle, hashing, or lowering creates a new semantic profile."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_moriarty_core_1", "label": "moriarty-core/1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_uint128_domain", "label": "UInt128 Domain U", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every literal, operand, and intermediate result must be in U={0..2^128-1}. Overflow must be detected before a later division. No reassociation, cancellation, widening, floating point, hidden division, or implicit rounding."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_amount_type", "label": "Amount<X>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_quantity_type", "label": "Quantity<q>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bool and Quantity are expression/local types only; they cannot be constants, arguments, observations, state, set results, effect operands, obligations, or receipts."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_floor_div", "label": "floor_div", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only division syntax. Evaluates numerator then denominator, rejects zero, returns mathematical floor because all values are unsigned."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_policy_target_binding", "label": "Static Financial Policy Binding", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Coverage is occurrence-based. Policies do not attach by similarly spelled names, and there is no default or heuristic propagation. Policy validation establishes binding and declared rounding provenance, not financial correctness, ACTUS conformance, or a proof."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_rounding_provenance", "label": "Rounding Provenance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each computed numeric value carries a finite set of FloorDiv node IDs. rounding none requires the empty set; rounding floor requires the singleton of that FloorDiv node. Provenance is checking metadata and is not persisted across actions."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_settlement_declaration", "label": "Settlement Declaration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One-to-one nominal-unit/ledger-asset binding. Runtime selection is exact, never first-match. No rounding or dust disposal occurs; a remainder rejects SETTLEMENT_NON_DIVISIBLE."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_settlement_quantum_conversion", "label": "Settlement Quantum Conversion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "quantum.value nominal subunits equal one ledger base unit. Require value mod quantum.value = 0, then ledgerAmount = floor_div(value, quantum.value), then reverse multiplication must recover value."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_obligation_transition", "label": "Obligation Transition", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This first atomic profile neither partially settles nor recreates an ID. Identity tombstones prevent duplicate create or settle. At most 128 ObligationRecord values including settled tombstones."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_obligation_partial_unsupported", "label": "OBLIGATION_PARTIAL_UNSUPPORTED", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_episode_status", "label": "EpisodeStatus", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Episode Closed never implies Agreement NoOutstanding."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_agreement_status", "label": "AgreementStatus", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_genesis_lifecycle", "label": "Genesis and Lifecycle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A continuation, redeployment, new request, or receipt cannot replace genesis or increase remaining/horizon. Split, join, Pending, and continuation export are unsupported."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_closure_reserve", "label": "Closure Reserve", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explicit, decidable, and hash-bound. No rule is inferred from an action name. It proves neither closure feasibility nor that the closure returns resources. A program without reserve declarations incurs no reserve check."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_binding_equalities", "label": "Binding Equalities", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_exact_plan", "label": "ExactPlan Authority", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_intent_refinement", "label": "IntentRefinement Authority", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refunds do not reduce gross debit. DueCreated and DueSettled contribute to neither debit nor credit sums. Text equality alone is never authentication."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_validation_stages", "label": "Thirteen Validation Stages", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Validate stages in numeric order and stop at the first failing stage. Return exactly one Diagnostic."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_closed_diagnostics", "label": "Closed DiagnosticCode Registry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_private_working_copy", "label": "Private Working Copy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejection exposes no working writes, effects, obligations, or authority consumption."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_remaining_allowance", "label": "Remaining Allowance", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_unsupported_pending", "label": "UNSUPPORTED_PENDING", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pending is not a result variant; a request needing residual progress rejects before commit. Complete does not mean the full contract is discharged."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_loan_example", "label": "Loan Example First LAM Period", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Specifies one first LAM period, not ACTUS conformance. Interest is 2,480,000,000/73 micro-USD, floor 33,972,602; combined settlement 533,972,602; remaining notional 4,500,000,000."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_swap_example", "label": "Swap Example", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not a reusable constant-product implementation or Uniswap conformance. Exact output 1,994,000,000/100,997, floor 19,743."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_no_user_functions", "label": "No User Functions Recursion or Loops", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recursive-looking expression records are finite bounded trees, not executable recursion."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_semantics_effect_schemas", "label": "Fixed Effect Schemas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/semantics.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Transfer and Fee propose asset movements. Due effects update the semantic obligation ledger. Neither 